35,2,1,talk,Shizue,,The closeout files show catalogue awards last longer. Mechanism ones stall.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"The ledgers show frozen travel costs, but shipping is up. Computing is free now.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Victoria,,The spectroscopy suite was idle for eleven weeks. That is a major risk.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,The portfolio review confirms it. Breeding colonies cause double the overruns.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Midori,,The station records show three sites lost a season. Indoor work is safer.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Victoria, that idle time is critical. Who covers the gap?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Benjamin, so live biology is the main source of delay?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Shizue, one engineer covers three institutes. It is stretched thin.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Ryuji, yes. Computation is safer. The computing agreement helps there.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Ryuji, the field sites lost seasons to weather. Indoor work is safer.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Shizue,,The minutes say the glasshouse crew is full strength. That is good.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,But the animal facility day rates rose sharply. That hurts budget.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Victoria,,The glasshouse is booked solid. We need to be careful with timing.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"If we pick a project needing the spectroscopy suite, we are in trouble.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Midori,,The station records confirm the field risk. Indoor holding rooms were fine.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Shizue,,We must weigh the human resources against the facility risks.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,The cost structure favors computation over animal work.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Victoria,,The shared instrumentation is a weak point.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,Avoid the projects that depend on the broken equipment.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Midori,,The data points to stability over novelty.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
